# Stowage Provider

The OpenTofu provider for [Stowage](https://github.com/norvexlabs/stowage). It reads only the
installer's machine interface ([guide](guides/machine-interface.md)) and decides nothing the
installer does not decide. Not in a registry yet: [install it locally](guides/install-without-registry.md).

